From 74bea828d35478b703415d1bec111a227b1a501d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:25:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] v8: TDZ checks for module bindings in lookup slots
 (4f37951e9a, crbug 587035145)

Port of V8 15.9 merge 4f37951e9a (M159; cherry-pick of main a5a56b7673),
adapted to 15.6 (context only; same added and removed lines).
Debug-evaluate lookups that resolved to a module binding returned the
TdzHole as a value, and stores wrote to uninitialized bindings. Throw a
ReferenceError in both cases, like the context-slot path.
